This app includes a stereo down-mix adapted from xenova/whisper-web
(https://github.com/xenova/whisper-web), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Xenova,
in frontend/src/app/services/transcription.service.ts.

At runtime it uses @huggingface/transformers (Apache-2.0) and ONNX Runtime Web (MIT).
Speech-model weights are downloaded from https://huggingface.co only after the user
agrees (Whisper and Moonshine ONNX builds; OpenAI Whisper weights are MIT-licensed).
